{"displayStem":"같은 카메라 방향과 배율로 보정한 상처 경계의 격자 모식도이다. 한 칸의 실제 면적은 0.25 cm²이다. 경계는 칸 경계와 일치하며 사선 칸은 없다. 점 표시 영역이 열린 상처이고 가는 이전, 나는 2주 뒤이다. 깊이는 이 평면 그림에서 측정하지 않았다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C08 c08-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><figure class=\"c08-panel\"><figcaption>상처 경계의 격자 모식도</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"가와 나의 보정된 상처 격자\"><rect width=\"580\" height=\"320\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"135\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\">가</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"55\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"></rect><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"75\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line><rect x=\"95\" y=\"55\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"></rect><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"75\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"95\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line><rect x=\"135\" y=\"55\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"></rect><circle cx=\"155\" cy=\"75\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"135\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line><rect x=\"175\" y=\"55\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"></rect><circle cx=\"195\" cy=\"75\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><line x1=\"175\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"95\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"></line><rect x=\"55\" y=\"95\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#aaa\" stroke-width=\"0.7\"></rect><circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"115\" r=\"2.5\" 